receding public reply is retained."},{["input"]="Fragments?",["previous_reply"]="I understand plain English. Mostly. Things you can ask me:\n      status               camp overview\n      who is here          your survivors and where they are\n      who is hurt          medical report\n      who is best at first aid   recorded skills at camp\n      how is <name>        one survivor, in detail\n      how many <item>      count it in camp storage\n      is that enough for 250   compare the last item with a quantity\n      how much food        food, calories and days left\n      how do I purify water / treat a wound   game survival reference\n      what is everyone doing   jobs and work orders\n      any problems         blocked or stuck jobs\n      shortages / alarms   stock targets and camp alerts\n      refuel generator / refuel <vehicle name>\n      send medic to <name> / retry job <job ID>\n      Requests need your Y/N confirmation before anything happens.\n      You can ask two questions together. Send each action request separately.\n      power / weather / time\n      how am I / am I infected   your condition; requires a recovered medical index\n      my kills / days survived / my skills   your own file, available anywhere\n      when is the helicopter / when will the water stop   recovered county calendar\n      weather tomorrow / next storm   forecast through the next six days\n      when is dawn / when does it get dark   the seasonal almanac\n      any zombies          movement near this building\n      expedition           news from the away team\n      deliveries           returned cargo awaiting storage\n      advice               what I would do, if I had hands\n      how do I <task>      operating help for camp jobs, travel and this station\n      tell me more / check again   follow the topic or refresh its readings\n      what were we talking about / back to <subject>\n      forget that conversation   clear the recent thread; keep saved notes\n      remember <note>      add a short note to the shared EMMA notebook\n      forget everything    choose which shared notes to erase\n      fragments            recovered computers and memory progress\n      factory reset        erase this computer's old files and branding; shared notes remain\n      open radio / scan for broadcasts   mounted walkie-talkie radio desk\n      save this channel as <name> / what did we hear\n      clear / exit\n    Or just talk to me. I am told it helps. I am told a lot of things.",["observed_intent"]="fragments",["id"]="real-20261109-main-32",["accept"]={"fragments"},["any"]={{"memory","fragment"}},["need"]="Answer the subject and facet in this turn; original preceding public reply is retained."},{["input"]="Open radio",["previous_reply"]="No shared memory is connected to this conversation.",["observed_intent"]="expedition",["id"]="real-20261109-main-33",["accept"]={"radio_help","radio","emma_controls","guide"},["any"]={{"radio","local services"}},["need"]="Answer the subject and facet in this turn; original preceding public reply is retained."},{["input"]="Tell me about popcorn?",["previous_reply"]="",["observed_intent"]="fallback_echo",["id"]="real-20261109-main-34",["accept"]={"fallback","fallback_echo","topic_help"},["any"]={{"people","supplies","food","topics"}},["need"]="Answer the subject and facet in this turn; original preceding public reply is retained."},{["input"]="How do people die?",["previous_reply"]="No record of popcorn. Either it does not matter or nobody wrote it down. Usually both.",["observed_intent"]="people_list",["id"]="real-20261109-main-35",["accept"]={},["any"]={{"infection","injur","blood","bite","disease","death"}},["need"]="Answer the subject and facet in this turn; original preceding public reply is retained."},{["input"]="How can i kill",["previous_reply"]="3 survivors on file:\n      Kate Miller .... at camp, 12 meters north-east, chopping wood\n      Bob Fisher .... at camp, right here, idle\n      Dale ...